{"path":"header/print","title":"Standard library header <print> (C++23)","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">Standard library header</span> &lt;print&gt;&nbsp;<span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(C++23)</span>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/header/print","section":"header","kind":"page","summary":"This header is part of the Input/Output library.","html":"<p>This header is part of the <a href=\"/w/cpp/io\">Input/Output</a> library.\n</p>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <h3 id=\"Functions\">Functions</h3>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/print\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>print</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(C++23)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  prints to <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/std_streams\">stdout</a></span> or a file stream using <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/format\">formatted</a> representation of the arguments <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/println\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>println</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(C++23)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  same as <span class=\"t-lc\">std::print</span> except that each print is terminated by additional new line <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/vprint_unicode\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>vprint_unicode</span><span>vprint_unicode_buffered</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(C++23)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  prints to Unicode capable <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/std_streams\">stdout</a></span> or a file stream using <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/format/basic_format_args\">type-erased</a> argument representation <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/vprint_nonunicode\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>vprint_nonunicode</span><span>vprint_nonunicode_buffered</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(C++23)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  prints to <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/std_streams\">stdout</a></span> or a file stream using <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/format/basic_format_args\">type-erased</a> argument representation <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Synopsis\">Synopsis</h3>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"kw1\">namespace</span> std <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"co1\">// print functions</span>\n  <span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw1\">class</span>... <span class=\"me1\">Args</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">void</span> print<span class=\"br0\">(</span>format_string<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Args...<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> fmt, Args<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span>... <span class=\"me1\">args</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw1\">class</span>... <span class=\"me1\">Args</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">void</span> print<span class=\"br0\">(</span>FILE<span class=\"sy2\">*</span> stream, format_string<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Args...<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> fmt, Args<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span>... <span class=\"me1\">args</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n  <span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw1\">class</span>... <span class=\"me1\">Args</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">void</span> println<span class=\"br0\">(</span>format_string<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Args...<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> fmt, Args<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span>... <span class=\"me1\">args</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"kw4\">void</span> println<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw1\">class</span>... <span class=\"me1\">Args</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">void</span> println<span class=\"br0\">(</span>FILE<span class=\"sy2\">*</span> stream, format_string<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Args...<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> fmt, Args<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span>... <span class=\"me1\">args</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"kw4\">void</span> println<span class=\"br0\">(</span>FILE<span class=\"sy2\">*</span> stream<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n  <span class=\"kw4\">void</span> vprint_unicode<span class=\"br0\">(</span>string_view fmt, format_args args<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"kw4\">void</span> vprint_unicode<span class=\"br0\">(</span>FILE<span class=\"sy2\">*</span> stream, string_view fmt, format_args args<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n  <span class=\"kw4\">void</span> vprint_unicode_locking<span class=\"br0\">(</span>FILE<span class=\"sy2\">*</span> stream, string_view fmt, format_args args<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n  <span class=\"kw4\">void</span> vprint_nonunicode<span class=\"br0\">(</span>string_view fmt, format_args args<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"kw4\">void</span> vprint_nonunicode<span class=\"br0\">(</span>FILE<span class=\"sy2\">*</span> stream, string_view fmt, format_args args<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n  <span class=\"kw4\">void</span> vprint_nonunicode_locking<span class=\"br0\">(</span>FILE<span class=\"sy2\">*</span> stream, string_view fmt, format_args args<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"References\">References</h3>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-c++23\">\n<ul><li> C++23 standard (ISO/IEC 14882:2024): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 31.7.4 Header <code>&lt;print&gt;</code> synopsis [print.syn] \n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 31.7.10 Print functions [print.fun] \n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Synopsis","id":"Synopsis"},{"depth":3,"text":"References","id":"References"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"header","title":"C++ Standard Library headers"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"Standard library header <print> (C++23)","children":[{"label":"Functions","children":[{"label":"print","note":"prints to stdout or a file stream using formatted representation of the arguments"},{"label":"println","note":"same as std::print except that each print is terminated by additional new line"},{"label":"vprint_unicode, vprint_unicode_buffered","note":"prints to Unicode capable stdout or a file stream using type-erased argument representation"},{"label":"vprint_nonunicode, vprint_nonunicode_buffered","note":"prints to stdout or a file stream using type-erased argument representation"}]},{"label":"Synopsis"},{"label":"References"}]},"standards":["C++23"],"wordCount":166,"codeBlockCount":1}
